sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Patient as Paciente
    participant UI as Frontend Paciente
    participant API as FastAPI /consultations
    participant Store as SQLRepository
    participant TRIAGE as triage_engine
    participant RAG as rag_service
    participant IDX as Artifact Index
    participant CORPUS as Corpus Curado

    Patient->>UI: Completa sintomas y contexto
    UI->>API: POST /consultations
    API->>Store: create_consultation(payload)
    Store-->>API: ConsultationRecord (SUBMITTED)
    API-->>UI: Consulta creada

    UI->>API: POST /consultations/{id}/triage
    API->>Store: get_consultation(id)
    Store-->>API: ConsultationRecord
    API->>TRIAGE: evaluate_consultation(consultation, rag_service)
    TRIAGE->>RAG: retrieve(query_terms)
    RAG->>IDX: cargar vectores y chunks
    RAG->>CORPUS: resolver metadatos y contenido curado
    CORPUS-->>RAG: documentos y chunks versionados
    RAG-->>TRIAGE: RetrievalTrace + evidence_sources rankeadas
    TRIAGE-->>API: triage_result + recommendation + metadata RAG
    API->>Store: save_triage(...)
    API->>Store: record_retrieval_trace(...)
    API->>Store: record_audit_event("rag.retrieve")
    Store-->>API: ConsultationRecord (RECOMMENDED/ESCALATED)
    API-->>UI: Resultado con severidad, decision, rank y score
